# LLM Wiki

This repo uses an LLM Wiki. Follow [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md):

- **Read-only:** `raw/` (never edit raw sources)
- **Write:** `wiki/` (agents own this layer)
- On ingest / filed answers / material code knowledge changes: update pages, `wiki/index.md`, and append `wiki/log.md`
- Start answers from `wiki/index.md` when the question is about project knowledge
